sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant ACD as Contact center
  participant PUB as PSA Publisher
  participant RD as Redis
  participant RC as RingCentral
  participant SUB as PSA Subscriber
  C->>ACD: Calls the contact center
  ACD->>PUB: AgentLegDialing, via Kinesis
  PUB->>RD: Set agent leg tag, status active
  ACD->>RC: Deliver the call to the agent's softphone
  RC-->>SUB: CallConnected
  SUB->>RD: Agent leg tag set?
  RD-->>SUB: Yes
  Note over SUB: Ignore: the contact center's own call
  C->>ACD: Hangs up
  ACD->>PUB: ContactRemoved, AgentLegDisconnected
  PUB->>RD: Agent leg status inactive
  RC-->>SUB: Second CallConnected, then NoCall
  Note over SUB: Handled: no state flip-flop
  Note over RC,SUB: Race fix: if the event beats the tag, check the number. A customer-line number means it's our call
